#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:4
msgid "裁剪显示(还没好)"
msgstr "Cropped display (not ready yet)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:9
msgid "裁剪显示节点用于在原图像上叠加显示检测区域的裁剪预览，将检测到的目标放大展示在图像的特定位置。"
msgstr ""
"The cropping display node is used to superimpose and display the cropping "
"preview of the detection area on the original image, and magnify the "
"detected target and display it at a specific position of the image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点常用于需要查看检测目标细节的场景，支持多种布局位置、边距调节和颜色方案配置，可以在不影响原图的情况下清晰展示多个检测目标。"
msgstr ""
"This node is often used in scenes where you need to view the details of the "
"detection target. It supports a variety of layout positions, margin "
"adjustments and color scheme configurations, and can clearly display "
"multiple detection targets without affecting the original image."

