#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:47
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:80
msgid "**预测显示**"
msgstr "**Forecast Display**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:48
msgid "要可视化的模型预测结果，选择检测模型的输出"
msgstr "To visualize model predictions, select Detection Model Outputs"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:49
msgid "从下拉菜单选择"
msgstr "Select from drop-down menu"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:50
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:84
msgid "**调色板**"
msgstr "**Palette**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:51
msgid "颜色调色板方案，用于为不同类别分配边框颜色"
msgstr ""
"Color palette scheme for assigning border colors to different categories"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:52
msgid "``DEFAULT``"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:53
msgid "**调色板大小**"
msgstr "**Palette size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:54
msgid "调色板中的颜色数量，适用于使用自定义或Matplotlib调色板时"
msgstr ""
"Number of colors in the palette, applicable when using a custom or "
"Matplotlib palette"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:55
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:56
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:92
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:57
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义边框颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, use HEX format to define border color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:58
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:59
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:60
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于类别（CLASS）来着色"
msgstr ""
"The basis for color assignment, usually coloring based on category (CLASS)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:61
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:62
msgid "**位置**"
msgstr "**Location**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:63
msgid "裁剪预览在图像上的显示位置"
msgstr "Where the crop preview appears on the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:64
msgid "``TOP_CENTER``"
msgstr "``TOP_CENTER``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:65
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:110
msgid "**边距数**"
msgstr "**Number of margins**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:66
msgid "裁剪预览框之间的间隔像素数"
msgstr "The number of pixels between crop preview frames"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:67
msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:68
msgid "**只展示最高分**"
msgstr "**Only show the highest scores**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:69
msgid "是否仅显示置信度最高的检测结果"
msgstr ""
"Whether to display only the detection results with the highest confidence"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:70
msgid "``False``"
msgstr "``False``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:73
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:77
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:78
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:82
msgid "选择要可视化的检测模型预测输出。从下拉菜单中选择上游检测模型节点的输出结果，支持目标检测、实例分割等模型类型。"
msgstr ""
"Select the detection model prediction output to visualize.Select the output "
"result of the upstream detection model node from the drop-down menu, "
"supporting model types such as target detection and instance segmentation."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:86
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案，用于裁剪预览的边框颜色："
msgstr ""
"Supports multiple color palette schemes for border colors of crop previews:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:88
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:89
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:90
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:94
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:100
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同类别的裁剪预览边框。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple respectively, the "
"colors will be assigned to different categories of crop preview borders in "
"order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:102
msgid "**颜色坐标轴(在CUSTOM模式下会被忽略)**"
msgstr "**Color axis (ignored in CUSTOM mode)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:104
msgid "决定如何为裁剪预览边框分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign color to the crop preview border:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:106
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:107
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:108
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:112
msgid "设置相邻裁剪预览框之间的间隔像素数。默认值为 ``2``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the number of pixels between adjacent crop preview boxes.The default "
"value is ``2``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:114
msgid "``0``：无间隔，裁剪预览紧密排列"
msgstr "``0``: no gap, crop previews are closely arranged"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:115
msgid "``2``：标准间隔（默认）"
msgstr "``2``: standard interval (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:116
msgid "``5`` 及以上：较大间隔"
msgstr "``5`` and above: Larger intervals"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/crop_display.rst:118
msgid "较大的边距值会使裁剪预览更加分散，便于区分，但占用更多空间。"
msgstr ""
"Larger margin values ​​make the crop preview more spread out, making it "
"easier to distinguish, but taking up more space."
